+				 * dereferencing a VA it merely handed out; userspace reads
+				 * its own mapping, where a fault is a user fault carrying
+				 * an esr/far record rather than a panic.
+				 *
+				 *   0xb9  a = returned address, b = SKIPPED marker,
+				 *         c = length, d = error
+				 */
+				if (sweet_mmap_records < 2) {
